{
  "_comment": [
    "The comparison registry: every experience the Compare engine can put",
    "side by side, with the attributes it scores.",
    "",
    "EVERY ATTRIBUTE DESCRIBES THE ROOM, NEVER THE OUTCOME. 'Physical",
    "intensity' and 'spoken guidance' are observable; 'stress relief' and",
    "'mental wellbeing' are therapeutic claims and are deliberately absent.",
    "That is the TGA line the rest of the site holds and this file must",
    "hold it too, because a scored table is a claim in its most quotable",
    "form. Add attributes that a visitor could verify by standing in the",
    "room; refuse attributes that promise what the hour will do to them.",
    "",
    "Scales run 1-5 and are editorial judgements of the TYPICAL session in",
    "Perth, drafted 25 Aug 2026 and reviewed by the owner. 'price' uses the",
    "directory's own bands. 'url' points at the experience's real page —",
    "a category, a specialty, or a facet — so the table links into the",
    "directory rather than dead-ending.",
    "",
    "Values ship here, in git, rather than in term meta: entered once,",
    "deployed with the code that reads them, same as every other registry",
    "in this folder."
  ],
  "attributes": {
    "physical": {
      "label": "Physical",
      "items": {
        "intensity": { "label": "Physical intensity", "type": "scale", "hint": "How hard the body works in a typical session" },
        "movement": { "label": "Movement", "type": "scale", "hint": "Still and lying down (1) to constantly moving (5)" },
        "stretch": { "label": "Stretching & mobility work", "type": "scale", "hint": "How much of the session is spent on it" },
        "strengthwork": { "label": "Strength work", "type": "scale", "hint": "Resistance, load or bodyweight effort" }
      }
    },
    "session": {
      "label": "In the room",
      "items": {
        "guidance": { "label": "Spoken guidance", "type": "scale", "hint": "Silent (1) to continuously instructed (5)" },
        "position": { "label": "You are mostly", "type": "text" },
        "quiet": { "label": "Quietness", "type": "scale", "hint": "Loud or music-led (1) to near silence (5)" },
        "touch": { "label": "Hands-on", "type": "text", "hint": "Whether a practitioner touches you" }
      }
    },
    "people": {
      "label": "People",
      "items": {
        "groupsize": { "label": "Typical group", "type": "text" },
        "social": { "label": "Interaction with others", "type": "scale" },
        "oneonone": { "label": "One-on-one available", "type": "text" },
        "experience": { "label": "Experience needed", "type": "text" }
      }
    },
    "practical": {
      "label": "Practical",
      "items": {
        "price": { "label": "Typical price", "type": "band" },
        "duration": { "label": "Typical session", "type": "text" },
        "athome": { "label": "Can be practised at home", "type": "text" }
      }
    }
  },
